DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
2723::$$$message_0018_0000_0000$$$::"Huh. No one's here."[lr]::
2724::$$$message_0018_0000_0001$$$::The note on the message board is in Sakura's handwriting: "I'm going back to my house for a bit."[lr]::
2725::$$$message_0018_0000_0002$$$::Rider and Saber left a sticky note on the refrigerator that reads, "going shopping in Shinto."[lr]::
2726::$$$message_0018_0000_0003$$$::Everyone else seems to be out at the moment, leaving me alone in the house.::
2727::$$$message_0018_0001_0000$$$::"...Oh well. Not like I have work today, so I'll hold down the[wvl][se storage=se027.wav]...hm?"[lr]::
2728::$$$message_0018_0001_0001$$$::The doorbell rings.[lr]::
2729::$$$message_0018_0001_0002$$$::I go to see who it is, and I am surprised[lr]::
2730::$$$message_0018_0001_0003$$$::by an unusual guest.::
2731::$$$message_0018_0002_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
2732::$$$message_0018_0002_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
2733::$$$message_0018_0002_0002$$$::For a moment, we stare at each other without saying anything.[lr]::
2734::$$$message_0018_0002_0003$$$::The opportunity to greet each other passes, not that he seems willing to do that, to begin with.[lr]::
2735::$$$message_0018_0002_0004$$$::If this was a combat sport, each fighter would be waiting to see who makes the first move, but it's not like he came here picking a fight.::
2736::$$$message_0018_0003_0000$$$::"Hey. Don't see you around every day. Are you here to check on Sakura?"[lr]::
2737::$$$message_0018_0003_0001$$$::"Not really. I just had something to do in the area. I'm on the way home."::
2738::$$$message_0018_0004_0000$$$::"Okay. You might as well come in if you have time.[lr]::
2739::$$$message_0018_0004_0001$$$::Since it's you, you're probably on foot. The Matou house is pretty far, so have a cup of tea before you go."[lr]::
2740::$$$message_0018_0004_0002$$$::"Tea? [cacheimage storage=慎二制服02a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=慎二制服02a(中)]...Well, I might as well. I'm not free, just so you know, but I'll stick around for a bit."[wvs][clfg textoff=0 pos=all time=400 rule=シャッター左から]::
2741::$$$message_0018_0005_0000$$$::"Yeah, do that.[lr]::
2742::$$$message_0018_0005_0001$$$::Sakura's out right now, but she'll probably show up after a while. You can wait for her here."[lr]::
2743::$$$message_0018_0005_0002$$$::"I told you, this doesn't involve her.[lr]::
2744::$$$message_0018_0005_0003$$$::Where's the living room, anyway? Your house is weirdly built and way too big."::
2745::$$$message_0018_0006_0000$$$::"Huh? Is this your first time in here?"[lr]::
2746::$$$message_0018_0006_0001$$$::"I've never been here before, so yeah. I was never interested in your house, Emiya."[lr]::
2747::$$$message_0018_0006_0002$$$::"I bet. We always used to hang out at your house. I felt bad asking you to come over here."[lr]::
2748::$$$message_0018_0006_0003$$$::"Obviously. Why would we have to come all the way out to these backwoods?[lr]::
2749::$$$message_0018_0006_0004$$$::My house is closer to school."::
2750::$$$message_0018_0007_0000$$$::As you can see, Shinji has never been inside my house before.[lr]::
2751::$$$message_0018_0007_0001$$$::He came over to pick up Sakura once, but only came as far as the front door.::
2752::$$$message_0018_0008_0000$$$::"Okay, this is the living room.[lr]::
2753::$$$message_0018_0008_0001$$$::The hallway earlier turns right to the dojo, and turns left to the guesthouse. Sakura uses one of the rooms there."[lr]::
2754::$$$message_0018_0008_0002$$$::"Huh. It's pretty far away."[lr]::
2755::$$$message_0018_0008_0003$$$::"That's what it took to get Fuji-nee's permission.[lr]::
2756::$$$message_0018_0008_0004$$$::So, you feel like your little sister's in safer hands yet?"::
2757::$$$message_0018_0009_0000$$$::"How many times do you have to make me say it, Emiya? I don't care about Sakura."[lr]::
2758::$$$message_0018_0009_0001$$$::That said, I notice Shinji stealing glances in the direction of the guesthouse.[lr]::
2759::$$$message_0018_0009_0002$$$::He probably is curious about Sakura's recent living situation.::
2760::$$$message_0018_0010_0000$$$::"Hey, do you want black or green tea?"[lr]::
2761::$$$message_0018_0010_0001$$$::I call to him from the kitchen.::
2762::$$$message_0018_0011_0000$$$::"Huh!? You drink black tea now, Emiya?"[lr]::
2763::$$$message_0018_0011_0001$$$::"Is that a surprise? ...Well, the majority of the residents here prefer black tea, so I have to deal with it.[lr]::
2764::$$$message_0018_0011_0002$$$::So which do you want?"::
2765::$$$message_0018_0012_0000$$$::"Hmm, I'm not interested in either.[lr]::
2766::$$$message_0018_0012_0001$$$::Anyway, where's your room? Let's go there first."[lr]::
2767::$$$message_0018_0012_0002$$$::Shinji's voice is lively for some reason.[lr]::
2768::$$$message_0018_0012_0003$$$::...Hm. It's not like there's anything interesting in my room.::
2769::$$$message_0018_0013_0000$$$::"It's right over there. Not as interesting as yours, though."[lr]::
2770::$$$message_0018_0013_0001$$$::"I'll be the judge of that.[lr]::
2771::$$$message_0018_0013_0002$$$::Come on, hurry up and show me. I came all this way, so I should get a look at my friend's bedroom."[lr]::
2772::$$$message_0018_0013_0003$$$::"Sure. Don't complain later, though."::
2773::$$$message_0018_0014_0000$$$::"Here?[lr]::
2774::$$$message_0018_0014_0001$$$::Cool! The innermost room of the house."[lr]::
2775::$$$message_0018_0014_0002$$$::"Yeah, I guess. It has the best placement."::
2776::$$$message_0018_0015_0000$$$::Shinji's eyes twinkle in anticipation.[lr]::
2777::$$$message_0018_0015_0001$$$::But that smile does a complete 180...[lr]::
2778::$$$message_0018_0015_0002$$$::...once I slide the door open.::
2779::$$$message_0018_0016_0000$$$::"What the hell? There's nothing here."[lr]::
2780::$$$message_0018_0016_0001$$$::"There isn't [font italic=true]nothing[font italic=false].[lr]::
2781::$$$message_0018_0016_0002$$$::I have a desk and a seat cushion. There's a small [font italic=true]bookshelf[font italic=false] in the corner, too."[lr]::
2782::$$$message_0018_0016_0003$$$::I place extra emphasis on the bookshelf.[lr]::
2783::$$$message_0018_0016_0004$$$::It's a piece of furniture I bought recently specifically to store the literature I've received from Rider.::
2784::$$$message_0018_0017_0000$$$::"The living room was better. Damn, you're as boring as ever, Emiya."[lr]::
2785::$$$message_0018_0017_0001$$$::After grumbling and doing a quick tour of my room, Shinji heads back to the living room.::
2786::$$$message_0018_0018_0000$$$::"So, what're you having, Shinji?"[lr]::
2787::$$$message_0018_0018_0001$$$::"Coffee, with milk and two spoons of sugar."[lr]::
2788::$$$message_0018_0018_0002$$$::"I only have normal cow's milk, though."[lr]::
2789::$$$message_0018_0018_0003$$$::"Cow's milk is fine. It's still better than powdered creamer.[lr]::
2790::$$$message_0018_0018_0004$$$::Ah, I don't need any snacks. Don't bother."[lr]::
2791::$$$message_0018_0018_0005$$$::"I appreciate that. The snack situation in this house is pretty strict."::
2792::$$$message_0018_0019_0000$$$::I brew coffee for two and return to the living room.[lr]::
2793::$$$message_0018_0019_0001$$$::Shinji's sitting there, looking unhappy.::
2794::$$$message_0018_0020_0000$$$::"...Hmph. You can serve black tea and even coffee now.[lr]::
2795::$$$message_0018_0020_0001$$$::You've changed, Emiya. Broadened your horizons lately."[lr]::
2796::$$$message_0018_0020_0002$$$::"I've always had black tea and coffee.[lr]::
2797::$$$message_0018_0020_0003$$$::I just prefer Japanese tea. I've always liked both, though."[lr]::
2798::$$$message_0018_0020_0004$$$::"Huh. So you weren't just copying Ryudou."::
2799::$$$message_0018_0021_0000$$$::"Actually, I wanted to ask you something.[lr]::
2800::$$$message_0018_0021_0001$$$::I heard you haven't been going to the kyudo club lately. Sakura's sad about it."[lr]::
2801::$$$message_0018_0021_0002$$$::"Why would I? Don't lump me in with Mitsuzuri.[lr]::
2802::$$$message_0018_0021_0003$$$::We're already halfway into our third year. I don't have time to be messing with clubs all day."[lr]::
2803::$$$message_0018_0021_0004$$$::"Why not? You could help Sakura.[lr]::
2804::$$$message_0018_0021_0005$$$::You don't really have a problem with her becoming captain, right?"::
2805::$$$message_0018_0022_0000$$$::"It might help her to have some responsibility.[lr]::
2806::$$$message_0018_0022_0001$$$::Sakura's got Mitsuzuri looking out for her, and that's enough.[lr]::
2807::$$$message_0018_0022_0002$$$::I'm not the only one who should show his face at the club. They've always been happier to see you than me. The fall tournament's coming up, too."::
2808::$$$message_0018_0023_0000$$$::"That's not true. I visit sometimes, sure, but I can't pick up a bow for the club anymore.[lr]::
2809::$$$message_0018_0023_0001$$$::It would be rude to everyone who's been there for three whole years for some occasional visitor to pick up a bow."[lr]::
2810::$$$message_0018_0023_0002$$$::"[font italic=true]What?[font italic=false] You're as soft as ever, man. Someone who's actually good doesn't need to fuss over stuff like that.[lr]::
2811::$$$message_0018_0023_0003$$$::There isn't anyone there as good as you, so don't worry about what the incompetent whiners think."::
2812::$$$message_0018_0024_0000$$$::"Well, thanks for that. But what about you, then?[lr]::
2813::$$$message_0018_0024_0001$$$::You're actually a good archer, and I don't mean that as flattery.[lr]::
2814::$$$message_0018_0024_0002$$$::It isn't too late for you to get some practice in before the tournament and make a good showing."::
2815::$$$message_0018_0025_0000$$$::"No thanks. Kyudo doesn't mean that much to me.[lr]::
2816::$$$message_0018_0025_0001$$$::I've graduated from it. It was just a way to kill time, that's all."[lr]::
2817::$$$message_0018_0025_0002$$$::"What a waste. You're a natural at it."::
2818::$$$message_0018_0026_0000$$$::"Ha! Your way of thinking is gravely flawed.[lr]::
2819::$$$message_0018_0026_0001$$$::I don't need to excel at any one art. That's a job for dissatisfied people.[lr]::
2820::$$$message_0018_0026_0002$$$::The plebs who work hard to try to polish some individual quality or skill they have are pathetic. Someone who's actually fulfilled in life doesn't need to do something like that."::
2821::$$$message_0018_0027_0000$$$::"And how does Tohsaka fit into that worldview?[lr]::
2822::$$$message_0018_0027_0001$$$::She can do anything, but she also tries to better herself at everything."[lr]::
2823::$$$message_0018_0027_0002$$$::"She's poor on an inborn level that nothing on this planet will ever fix.[lr]::
2824::$$$message_0018_0027_0003$$$::Everything comes easy to her, but she still chooses to suffer."::
2825::$$$message_0018_0028_0000$$$::"...That feels right on the mark. Sharp eye, Shinji."[lr]::
2826::$$$message_0018_0028_0001$$$::"Duh. I've been watching Tohsaka for a long time. I've got the edge on analyzing her."::
2827::$$$message_0018_0029_0000$$$::Shinji downs the rest of his cup of coffee.[lr]::
2828::$$$message_0018_0029_0001$$$::After a moment of philosophical indifference...[lr]::
2829::$$$message_0018_0029_0002$$$::"Hey, I'll have another.[lr]::
2830::$$$message_0018_0029_0003$$$::The coffee here's pretty good."[lr]::
2831::$$$message_0018_0029_0004$$$::...he haughtily thrusts his coffee mug at me.::
2832::$$$message_0018_0030_0000$$$::Our meandering conversation continues.[lr]::
2833::$$$message_0018_0030_0001$$$::We're both on our fourth cup of coffee now.[lr]::
2834::$$$message_0018_0030_0002$$$::Shinji updates me on his recent life, such as how incompetent his more experienced coworkers are at the new part-time job he started recently, and how old-fashioned they do things there.::
2835::$$$message_0018_0031_0000$$$::If I didn't know the context, I'd call it a bunch of whining, but I'm actually aware of the reputation Shinji's workplace has.[lr]::
2836::$$$message_0018_0031_0001$$$::According to Neko, ever since an unfriendly new employee started working at Kitamura Chaya, their quality has gone up and their prices have gone down.::
2837::$$$message_0018_0032_0000$$$::"I'm surprised you got a job, though."[lr]::
2838::$$$message_0018_0032_0001$$$::Tohsaka's said that the Matou family is quite well-off.[lr]::
2839::$$$message_0018_0032_0002$$$::Old Zouken is sitting on a hefty retirement fund.::
2840::$$$message_0018_0033_0000$$$::"I'm just doing it as a change of pace.[lr]::
2841::$$$message_0018_0033_0001$$$::...I'll need my own source of income once I graduate, though. I can't count on my savings, so I'd better earn some money while I can."[lr]::
2842::$$$message_0018_0033_0002$$$::"Huh...? Are you leaving home once you graduate?"::
2843::$$$message_0018_0034_0000$$$::"Not really, but if I do leave, I'd be an idiot to be broke when I do.[lr]::
2844::$$$message_0018_0034_0001$$$::...Still, I'm about 80% leaning towards moving to Tokyo."[lr]::
2845::$$$message_0018_0034_0002$$$::"..."::
2846::$$$message_0018_0035_0000$$$::Another surprise.[lr]::
2847::$$$message_0018_0035_0001$$$::Shinji's leaving... That's more significant than the typical young adult moving out.[lr]::
2848::$$$message_0018_0035_0002$$$::The Matous are a lineage of mages.[lr]::
2849::$$$message_0018_0035_0003$$$::Even if Shinji, or the entire family, lacks the aptitude for magecraft, I still wouldn't expect him to leave, knowing what he knows.[lr]::
2850::$$$message_0018_0035_0004$$$::If he were to leave, that would mean that...::
2851::$$$message_0018_0036_0000$$$::"Shinji, wouldn't that mean that you'd be cutting ties with the Matous?"[lr]::
2852::$$$message_0018_0036_0001$$$::"If I tell Grandpa, that's probably what'll happen.[lr]::
2853::$$$message_0018_0036_0002$$$::...My father had a little brother, actually. When he left home and moved somewhere else, he was as good as disowned. That's what it means to leave Fuyuki."::
2854::$$$message_0018_0037_0000$$$::"...I see. And Sakura?"[lr]::
2855::$$$message_0018_0037_0001$$$::"I already told her. I told her to think hard about her future, too.[lr]::
2856::$$$message_0018_0037_0002$$$::If I leave home, then the Matou are finished. There won't be anyone left to inherit the family legacy, so she'll have to leave, too."::
2857::$$$message_0018_0038_0000$$$::"Shinji..."[lr]::
2858::$$$message_0018_0038_0001$$$::"What? I'm just stating the facts.[lr]::
2859::$$$message_0018_0038_0002$$$::Oh, just so you know, the family inheritance is mine.[lr]::
2860::$$$message_0018_0038_0003$$$::I'm coming back to claim it once Grandpa kicks the bucket, so I told Sakura not to waste it."::
2861::$$$message_0018_0039_0000$$$::Even though I've known Shinji for five years, I still can't tell if he's bluffing or genuinely concerned for Sakura.[lr]::
2862::$$$message_0018_0039_0001$$$::...Still, he's making the best choice for Sakura, in his own way.::
2863::$$$message_0018_0040_0000$$$::"Anyway. You and I are actually going to graduate together for the second time.[lr]::
2864::$$$message_0018_0040_0001$$$::Back when I met you, I didn't think we'd know each other for this long."[lr]::
2865::$$$message_0018_0040_0002$$$::"Yeah. Thinking about it, we didn't really have any common interests. We spent more time chatting about random stuff than actually going out anywhere."::
2866::$$$message_0018_0041_0000$$$::"Going places with you would've been boring anyway.[lr]::
2867::$$$message_0018_0041_0001$$$::I only spent time with you when I didn't have anything else to do."[lr]::
2868::$$$message_0018_0041_0002$$$::"You're actually saying that? I jumped in to help you in fights probably ten, no, twenty times.[lr]::
2869::$$$message_0018_0041_0003$$$::You were always getting into it with the older guys at our usual meetup place after school."::
2870::$$$message_0018_0042_0000$$$::"That wasn't just about me. They went after me because of you, too.[lr]::
2871::$$$message_0018_0042_0001$$$::I stand out wherever I go, so there's nothing I can do about that, but when we were kids, it was easy for busybodies like you to make enemies."::
2872::$$$message_0018_0043_0000$$$::...I do feel that he's right, now that he mentions it.[lr]::
2873::$$$message_0018_0043_0001$$$::I think back to five years ago.[lr]::
2874::$$$message_0018_0043_0002$$$::I first got to know Shinji Matou just about the same time of the year as right now.::
2875::$$$message_0018_0044_0000$$$::One day after school, we were getting ready for the cultural festival happening the next day.[lr]::
2876::$$$message_0018_0044_0001$$$::One first-year was surrounded by several third-years.[lr]::
2877::$$$message_0018_0044_0002$$$::They were giving him a hard time for making a sign that was different from their design.[lr]::
2878::$$$message_0018_0044_0003$$$::...I knew that the first-year had spent days making the sign on his own, while the third-years didn't lift a hand to help.[lr]::
2879::$$$message_0018_0044_0004$$$::I ended up throwing my two cents in and got real worked up about it.::
2880::$$$message_0018_0045_0000$$$::"Shut up. In that case, why don't you remake it by yourself by tomorrow?"[lr]::
2881::$$$message_0018_0045_0001$$$::The third-years said they'd overlook the first-year's failure on that condition.[lr]::
2882::$$$message_0018_0045_0002$$$::Tit for tat, so to speak.[lr]::
2883::$$$message_0018_0045_0003$$$::I took the bait and stayed up all night by myself making a new sign.::
2884::$$$message_0018_0046_0000$$$::There was another kid in my year who watched me from start to finish.[lr]::
2885::$$$message_0018_0046_0001$$$::He watched me as I stayed behind, making fun of me the entire time, never leaving me alone.::
2886::$$$message_0018_0047_0000$$$::All he said was,[lr]::
2887::$$$message_0018_0047_0001$$$::"You're an idiot. You could've just said nothing."[lr]::
2888::$$$message_0018_0047_0002$$$::and,[lr]::
2889::$$$message_0018_0047_0003$$$::"Don't you get that they're taking advantage of you?[lr]::
2890::$$$message_0018_0047_0004$$$::The dumbass third-years and the first-year that thanked you already forgot about you and went home."[lr]::
2891::$$$message_0018_0047_0005$$$::And so forth. He didn't stop me, but he kept nagging me.::
2892::$$$message_0018_0048_0000$$$::Then, the next morning,[lr]::
2893::$$$message_0018_0048_0001$$$::when I finished the sign according to the third-years' specifications...[lr]::
2894::$$$message_0018_0048_0002$$$::"Huh. You're stupid, but that's good work."[lr]::
2895::$$$message_0018_0048_0003$$$::He laughed, as pleased and proud as if he'd made the sign himself.::
2896::$$$message_0018_0049_0000$$$::...That's how I met Shinji Matou.[lr]::
2897::$$$message_0018_0049_0001$$$::Our relationship continued until we graduated middle school and as we entered the same high school, but we started to drift apart once I joined the kyudo club.::
2898::$$$message_0018_0050_0000$$$::...The event that resolved our falling-out happened half a year ago.[lr]::
2899::$$$message_0018_0050_0001$$$::We didn't quite return to the way we were five years ago, but the fact we can make small talk again means that we've begun to bury the hatchet.::
2900::$$$message_0018_0051_0000$$$::The clock rings three o'clock.[lr]::
2901::$$$message_0018_0051_0001$$$::Shinji finishes his fourth cup of coffee and stands up.::
2902::$$$message_0018_0052_0000$$$::"It's already this late, huh? I've got an appointment to keep, so I'm leaving.[lr]::
2903::$$$message_0018_0052_0001$$$::...Also, don't get any funny ideas about me showing up here today."[lr]::
2904::$$$message_0018_0052_0002$$$::"Sure thing. Are you sure, though? Sakura should be back soon."::
2905::$$$message_0018_0053_0000$$$::"It's fine. I don't like noise.[lr]::
2906::$$$message_0018_0053_0001$$$::Just imagining everyone else being here makes me feel sick."::
2907::$$$message_0018_0054_0000$$$::I watch my friend of five years leave.[lr]::
2908::$$$message_0018_0054_0001$$$::"Oh, yeah[line len=2]I don't expect you to get a computer, but you should at least put a TV in your room.[lr]::
2909::$$$message_0018_0054_0002$$$::Just because you're a mage doesn't mean you have to live in the bronze age."[lr]::
2910::$$$message_0018_0054_0003$$$::Shinji leaves me with that biting remark.::
2911::$$$message_0018_0055_0000$$$::However...[lr]::
2912::$$$message_0018_0055_0001$$$::While I'm much obliged for his suggestion, I actually do have a computer or two in the shed.[lr]::
2913::$$$message_0018_0055_0002$$$::"Hmm..."[lr]::
2914::$$$message_0018_0055_0003$$$::Maybe I should've corrected Shinji's mistake and told him how relatively high-tech my house is...::
902736::$$$message_9018_0003_0000$$$::"Hey. Don't see you around every day. Are you here to check on Sakura?"[r]::
G